Android port: five more interface languages (Croatian, Romanian, Hungarian, Slovak, Norwegian).

The language table gets hr, ro, hu, sk and no, with catalogs for the strings the phone interface shows (slider
and section names, white balance modes, masking, presets). Strings with no entry stay English. The catalogs have no
format-string files, so messages with arguments stay English too. `nb` and `nn` tags resolve to Norwegian.
